<title>USA: Keystone names Robert Singer chief executive.</title>
<headline>Keystone names Robert Singer chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keystone Consolidated Industries Inc said it has named Robert Singer as its president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Singer, who has over 20 years' experience in the steel, wire and wire products industries, has been president and chief operating officer of the company since 1988.</p>
<p>Singer assumes the CEO title from Glenn R. Simmons, who will remain chairman of the board.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
